stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Discovered
    Discovered --> Invalid: parse or compile fails
    Discovered --> Applied: patch the sandbox copy
    Applied --> Killed: at least one test fails
    Applied --> Survived: every test passes
    Applied --> TimedOut: per mutant budget reached
    Killed --> [*]
    Survived --> [*]
    TimedOut --> [*]
    Invalid --> [*]

    note right of Survived
        A survivor is a missing assertion.
        Repair proposes a test.
        The verifier must kill this mutant.
    end note
